| Security risk                          | Required protection                                                   |
| -------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Someone else gives the thumbs-up       | Verify the authorized student's face continuously during confirmation |
| The recognized face disappears         | Cancel the payment                                                    |
| Another person replaces the student    | Cancel the payment if identity verification fails                     |
| Two or more faces appear               | Cancel the payment                                                    |
| Someone holds up a photograph          | Add face liveness and anti-spoofing checks                            |
| Someone replays a previous gesture     | Require a fresh gesture for each payment                              |
| Gesture detection is unstable          | Require a stable gesture held for a minimum duration                  |
| Student has insufficient funds         | Enforce the balance check inside the database transaction             |
| Two payments happen concurrently       | Preserve atomic wallet updates                                        |
| The application crashes during payment | Prevent partial wallet/transaction updates                            |
| A payment is cancelled                 | Do not deduct money                                                   |
| Someone modifies the database directly | Add appropriate database access controls and integrity checks         |
